  {
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "> [@esc](https://github.com/esc) My bad, I was under the impression all numpy functions were available. I don't know how I did not come across the implementation table while looking for a way to solve the error I got, thank you for sharing the link!\n\nNo worries. The way Numba works, is that most (all?) NumPy functions must be re-implemented in pure Python such that Numba can compile them. Hence the coverage for NumPy is slowly continuously expanding, but limited. Pull-requests for missing things are generally welcome.\n\n",
